@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "前台" as A0
boundary "<u>:前台接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:办理复诊随访联</u>\n<u>系控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:诊后要求</u>" as Followup
participant "<u>:联系经历</u>" as Contact
participant "<u>:预约</u>" as Appointment
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-13办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-13办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Followup : 提供待联系事项(负责前台、日期)
activate Followup
Followup --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Followup
K -> Followup : 登记联系结果(实际结果、下次日期)
activate Followup
Followup -> Contact : 追加联系经历(方式、时间、患者反馈)
activate Contact
Contact --> Followup : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Contact
Followup --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Followup
opt 联系结果关联复诊预约
K -> Appointment : 核对复诊关联(同患者有效预约)
activate Appointment
Appointment --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Appointment
end
K -> Followup : 衔接后续安排(预约或待评估)
activate Followup
Followup --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Followup
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Appointment
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
